<p local-id=3D"9c1c29bf24a0">Child Pages:</p>
<ul class=3D"childpages-macro">
<li><a href=3D"https://lmsportal.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020074374fdd=
f954a4da6aac22d0a1d0c40/pages/28828696585/EV+Reports+Documentation" data-li=
nked-resource-id=3D"28828696585" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-li=
nked-resource-type=3D"page">EV+ Reports Documentation</a></li>
</ul>
<h1 local-id=3D"e0eb82f060d1" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Problem:">Pr=
oblem:</h1>
<p local-id=3D"18af8f533485">The current reports page needs redesign for bo=
th compliance and usability reasons.</p>
<p local-id=3D"53595d8c9492">The most urgent issue is that the page does no=
t meet <strong>WCAG 2.1 Level A and AA accessibility standards</strong>, cr=
eating compliance risk and limiting usability for customers who rely on acc=
essible experiences.</p>
<p local-id=3D"e89ae4879d4b">In addition, the page must be <strong>migrated=
 to microservices</strong>, making this redesign an opportunity to moderniz=
e both the technical foundation and the user experience at the same time.</=
p>
<p local-id=3D"ddfa2650edaa">From a customer experience perspective, the cu=
rrent reports page has several core pain points:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"7cbe492d-0336-404d-8c66-90ecca04e9b3">
<li local-id=3D"efe21e48-e77f-44ef-b8b4-fc590ea43b86">
<p local-id=3D"8208388f67ec"><strong>Unintuitive parameter and filter selec=
tion workflows</strong>, making it difficult for users to understand how to=
 configure and run reports</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9502ae07-1129-4019-936b-6425e4407a34">
<p local-id=3D"f78fadc3d0d2"><strong>Lack of data visualizations</strong>, =
limiting the usefulness and interpretability of results on-screen</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fa94583e-8481-48f7-a995-9cf70fead14b">
<p local-id=3D"80b72ec06ec4"><strong>Slow report generation times</strong>,=
 which creates frustration and reduces trust in the reporting experience</p=
></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"44fa53dfa278">This project is <strong>not</strong> intended =
to change existing report logic or create new reports. Scope is limited to =
the <strong>reports page UI</strong>, including:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"3069055d-e2ac-4710-9fa3-856e480cd029">
<li local-id=3D"71c1c287-16bc-472e-8b60-c6c4ce76734b">
<p local-id=3D"98b553fcdddc">the report filters / parameter configuration e=
xperience</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9b59e37c-a0b0-4d59-8b82-01dfeee25c24">
<p local-id=3D"9b19d387a33c">the on-screen display of generated reports</p>=
</li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"ea8ce547fc84">This means the redesign focuses on improving a=
ccessibility, usability, clarity, and front-end experience without altering=
 the underlying report catalog or report definitions.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"8a0182000ad1" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Inscope">In =
scope</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"0ae76347-b07a-4bcb-ae47-db31ff012ffd">
<li local-id=3D"0d0a9b89-2bc1-49d9-aace-0ee2cb1ab519">
<p local-id=3D"c69a87b2147d">Redesign of the reports page UI</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"88462643a9b2">
<p local-id=3D"4f7762dde656">Regrouping/organization of reports</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bd6a7a21-f8fe-48ec-80d5-528852dbdba9">
<p local-id=3D"c9796dce510e">Accessible filter and parameter selection work=
flows</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8288d11f-4b87-47fb-934a-3c0528224396">
<p local-id=3D"8faa158823b0">Accessible display of generated reports on scr=
een</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d2448046-bed7-439e-96b4-a1420e9211ad">
<p local-id=3D"297156c183c2">Improved usability and clarity of the report-r=
unning flow</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f67e7928-0b4d-4d21-9993-a9d885bf7ca6">
<p local-id=3D"93d5d7115bb8">Introduction of data visualization patterns wh=
ere appropriate in the on-screen experience</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a93cc29e-0997-4dc4-bc7e-17408dc5b1a8">
<p local-id=3D"8cf026a3e0e1">Migration of the reports page to microservices=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b2c1f290-4ccc-4882-ae37-3db852944532">
<p local-id=3D"72c49438f856">Improvements that support WCAG 2.1 A and AA co=
mpliance</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"1390e845825c" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Outofscope">=
Out of scope</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"8384ae46-59ca-4ab5-a78c-5195654621f8">
<li local-id=3D"f7b2181f-3311-4f5f-8c28-3401f7b3646e">
<p local-id=3D"41535b3bb88e">Creating new reports</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d78e48f2-a5bb-4b00-b589-21beb574ff7c">
<p local-id=3D"9a4bdcddc437">Changing report logic or calculations</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5624b194-b94f-4e53-87fa-f36102980468">
<p local-id=3D"bafb95185863">Changing the underlying data included in repor=
ts</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b6705b51-1762-47db-956b-6a2d3ae5984f">
<p local-id=3D"1360c17e82ce">Replacing the report catalog itself, unless ne=
eded for the page UI redesign</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1dfc41cf-8067-4647-bd52-de22c392d702">
<p local-id=3D"cd717de1d1e1">Major changes to backend report definitions be=
yond what is required for migration/support of the new UI</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"60749dc78383" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Product/Busi=
nessContext">Product / Business Context</h2>
<p local-id=3D"eb714b2eefc6">The reports page is a <strong>shared experienc=
e across Evaluations+ and PD Tracking</strong>. The reports available to a =
user depend on both:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"923ce0a3-ca31-40ee-8d0d-62d817730604">
<li local-id=3D"8e44e1bd-8f3e-47d5-8083-d3362c2fb0df">
<p local-id=3D"acb409b4a56f">which products the customer account owns</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"6c553377-acdf-438d-a73b-d6ef3a6d736d">
<p local-id=3D"ad9ebdabfac1">the user=E2=80=99s permissions</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"cfc29d70cade">Primary users are <strong>admins and evaluator=
s</strong>, though <strong>end users</strong> and <strong>system administra=
tors</strong> also access reporting. This means the redesigned experience m=
ust support a range of user types with different goals, levels of familiari=
ty, and access levels.</p>
<p local-id=3D"a453820efb12">Because reporting is a cross-product experienc=
e, the redesign should prioritize consistency, clarity, and permission-awar=
e behavior so users can easily understand what reports are available to the=
m and how to run them.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"e6f3a4bd2d03" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Goals/Object=
ives">Goals / Objectives</h2>
<p local-id=3D"ca827d5e755b">This redesign aims to modernize the reports pa=
ge UI while preserving the existing report set and report logic.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"668369adde43" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Primarygoals=
">Primary goals</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"c86d9e76-7901-44db-bb30-19a7376beaea">
<li local-id=3D"b50a901a-951b-4eb0-8999-8d8d490747f4">
<p local-id=3D"2e2fc4563a82">Bring the reports page into compliance with <s=
trong>WCAG 2.1 Level A and AA</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"443bff8d-9c1a-48c2-ae84-e84019675d0b">
<p local-id=3D"b3a7348237d9">Improve the usability of report parameter and =
filter selection workflows</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"60af1617-67fc-43dc-82e8-d2ca5c6dabfb">
<p local-id=3D"b8957238b612">Reduce the time and effort required for users =
to configure and run reports</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f1328c4f-a024-4138-b324-8ba70f6a65cb">
<p local-id=3D"8c6ff95a7243">Improve report generation performance, or at m=
inimum improve the perceived responsiveness of the experience during report=
 generation</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9175d9b6-48cf-4902-9741-8bab73955cca">
<p local-id=3D"fea8f4b9ae46">Migrate the page to a <strong>microservices-ba=
sed architecture</strong></p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"21e804bba35f" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Secondarygoa=
ls">Secondary goals</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"ff5219b0-9a7f-499c-991d-462097898557">
<li local-id=3D"83ff4889-cab7-4353-8a16-a801dd43fe2b">
<p local-id=3D"28bbd11cc6b7">Modernize the visual presentation of report re=
sults</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"698b1a92-6a47-4b3f-a530-b727ace3fbc7">
<p local-id=3D"dfaa05c05af7">Introduce lightweight, more useful data visual=
izations where appropriate</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a45c5905-09b1-4beb-a243-d686fe183165">
<p local-id=3D"5d2ddf4536e6">Improve the readability and interpretability o=
f on-screen report results</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a1a5a9d8-6180-4d2c-85d1-8e72f79fef2f">
<p local-id=3D"d8a05e7d98ba">Reduce support burden caused by confusion in t=
he reporting workflow</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"a201808f0318" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-SuccessMetri=
cs">Success Metrics</h2>
<p local-id=3D"aa1226088c6f">You can use these as draft success metrics:</p=
>
<h3 local-id=3D"3c792d48e4d2" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Accessibilit=
y">Accessibility</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"74c72a82-9a48-4ffe-87e7-affd6055b94c">
<li local-id=3D"0523ef15-f0e5-4b36-8d35-e7cf0dcfe138">
<p local-id=3D"d8fe803e2286">Reports page meets <strong>WCAG 2.1 A and AA</=
strong> requirements before release</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bb71afc2-eb7d-4713-876e-4e2dbaaa8268">
<p local-id=3D"0a3331438a96">Accessibility audit issues are resolved for cr=
itical and high-priority violations</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6b833823-7bf7-45f8-99f6-1cf8b4b89f93">
<p local-id=3D"ca2d082949ea">Core reporting workflows are fully usable by k=
eyboard and screen reader users</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"1227029e2ee0" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Usability">U=
sability</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"813b7a4e-be20-4ec5-97d5-b232cffabc7a">
<li local-id=3D"2cb5e44e-13d9-4575-82d5-42c8a7ce7cf9">
<p local-id=3D"28405912d20e">Reduction in user confusion during filter/para=
meter selection</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f8eac5e0-3964-4077-b4ae-ef409a0d7240">
<p local-id=3D"2de91844f20f">Reduced time to configure and run a report</p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"bd941aee-6795-4ed7-a5ef-4101ff24c952">
<p local-id=3D"d741aee82556">Improved completion rate for report-running wo=
rkflows without assistance</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7315c8ce-0c95-4f0c-a31f-c8c092b24289">
<p local-id=3D"fc71c696e699">Positive internal or customer feedback on ease=
 of use</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"df1a02e7327d" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Performance"=
>Performance</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"b395d8d8-7ebd-4cb6-afff-df3da8ba7787">
<li local-id=3D"2632ff2d-2a9a-4e1e-800e-458ec25e2849">
<p local-id=3D"bf049c766056">Reduced report generation wait times where tec=
hnically feasible</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8fdf41af-d7be-4acd-ab0b-8361923fa2d7">
<p local-id=3D"bb4c7d561a7a">Improved perceived responsiveness through clea=
rer loading/progress states</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"acbabe22-5c86-4405-9a97-78dcb668a463">
<p local-id=3D"3c82d999b9fe">Fewer abandoned report attempts caused by dela=
ys or uncertainty</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"8d5b610357f0" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Business/Ope=
rational">Business / Operational</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"08839e13-9a43-445c-af2d-e92f586faac8">
<li local-id=3D"eb11aaed-c30c-4b54-9b86-c503c2dae730">
<p local-id=3D"40ffc02947ba">Reduction in support tickets or customer compl=
aints related to reports UX</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4f6f7ae9-c1c0-467e-855d-40fc843fa49a">
<p local-id=3D"93bf4fb4de3e">Successful migration of the reports page to mi=
croservices without regression in core workflows</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"206719746164" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-ExperienceDi=
rection/UXPrinciples">Experience Direction / UX Principles</h2>
<p local-id=3D"da37d7593b04">Since you do not have mockups yet, it helps to=
 define principles:</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"e950a01f2919" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-ProposedUXpr=
inciples">Proposed UX principles</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"fababd00-db98-478c-aff7-3e92c0765b02">
<li local-id=3D"4913c5a9-8b61-40cb-a01b-950f160ede65">
<p local-id=3D"7bcae340cf78"><strong>Accessible by default</strong>: every =
core workflow must support keyboard navigation, screen readers, focus visib=
ility, color contrast, labeling, and error handling</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fde18874-cdf2-4432-94f2-9207462ea1ed">
<p local-id=3D"e6612b6a67a8"><strong>Clear before clever</strong>: filter a=
nd parameter setup should be easy to understand, with obvious next steps</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"408ad089-6499-4825-a0ee-8a23581005e2">
<p local-id=3D"3c29efd8fa04"><strong>Lightweight modernization</strong>: vi=
sualizations should support comprehension without turning reports into dash=
boards</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"536c81e9-9266-418e-a4e8-498275eca42b">
<p local-id=3D"137d3468264d"><strong>Results-first readability</strong>: on=
-screen report output should make tables and summaries easier to scan and i=
nterpret</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"88b5b253-ba8d-4f54-ac7d-01de5b402b35">
<p local-id=3D"4abcb241a977"><strong>Permission-aware simplicity</strong>: =
users should only see reports and actions relevant to their products and pe=
rmissions</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7e477475-dd5b-43e5-bcab-ebf455441a1a">
<p local-id=3D"f4584ece6593"><strong>Responsive feedback</strong>: the syst=
em should clearly communicate loading, progress, empty states, and errors</=
p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"c050c0f12b6c">
<h1 local-id=3D"4ca74863f7b6" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-AdditionalBr=
ainstormingwithAI">Additional Brainstorming with AI</h1>
<h2 local-id=3D"940bfc386fce" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Current-Stat=
eUserProblems">Current-State User Problems</h2>
<p local-id=3D"f9eb7e7d5d37">Users struggle to configure and interpret repo=
rts efficiently in the current experience.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"044fe43b5554" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Filterandpar=
ameterworkflowproblems">Filter and parameter workflow problems</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"ea5d2796-a525-4428-8371-07e5e70f5046">
<li local-id=3D"bb53c957-8aa2-445b-a740-44ebe61f52ca">
<p local-id=3D"83b89f618c01">Filters are difficult to understand and use co=
nsistently</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a9caaaca-37dd-4465-bae3-8d7a2ae87421">
<p local-id=3D"50cb90bd8ea4">Filter controls often appear as simple dropdow=
ns, but selecting an option may unexpectedly launch a modal for additional =
selection steps</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f53f5ecd-b385-430e-b2bd-58c1fb8e7546">
<p local-id=3D"9e1c970fea08">Changing one filter can unexpectedly reset or =
alter other filters, which makes the experience feel unstable and hard to p=
redict</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"14096b22-1a2d-478a-9d8f-53ffb9c141d9">
<p local-id=3D"4f53af737cd8">Similar filter types appear differently across=
 reports, making it difficult for users to recognize repeatable patterns or=
 build confidence using the page</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"25fe5ef7-ff27-4198-912f-47b939fe7d5d">
<p local-id=3D"75643574be53">Users must spend unnecessary effort understand=
ing the mechanics of the UI rather than focusing on the reporting question =
they are trying to answer</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"9f089ee37204" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Reportgenera=
tionproblems">Report generation problems</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"d691035a-95db-4630-961b-6d3c692b61b1">
<li local-id=3D"bf2d3fd8-a683-4eb9-86f0-fb9174d587c6">
<p local-id=3D"1484fbf407bb">When a report is generated, the primary feedba=
ck is a loading spinner</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"94a75447-5742-483e-9778-8d5733cc0666">
<p local-id=3D"ffbd18727d68">Slow generation times create frustration and r=
educe trust in the workflow</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a545d826c06c">
<p local-id=3D"ec16d68fd767">Certain reports do have helpful data visualiza=
tion that load in the UI; however, the report exports are all spreadsheets =
(currently), so moving those reports to async. will come with a loss of vis=
ualizations that customer like and want more of</p>
<ul local-id=3D"30fa667c8244">
<li local-id=3D"e4e669383a59">
<p local-id=3D"a6738831474d">PDF versions are not currently available (but =
desired)</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"3149c845655a" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Resultsdispl=
ayproblems">Results display problems</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"894849b8-ba36-4f56-a724-2c3ac91646d9">
<li local-id=3D"902fc8a3-5227-438f-a2f4-2dacb28e2712">
<p local-id=3D"7f7ee8988787">On-screen tables are hard to scan and interpre=
t quickly</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"78ec3704-52b1-4f16-b5a7-3c75fed05004">
<p local-id=3D"fcccc82789d6">Visualization support is limited and not espec=
ially useful in its current form</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"513fb7f3-0530-4af6-992a-2ce5aca9ec27">
<p local-id=3D"b8d625e6a1dc">Existing charts are lightweight but dated, and=
 they do not meaningfully improve comprehension for most reports</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"826548fb-88b5-42b6-a716-a821ec31f49c">
<p local-id=3D"c995b5a8b0bd">The overall results experience feels outdated =
and does not help users efficiently consume the data before exporting it</p=
></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"02e461459426" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Accessibilit=
yproblems">Accessibility problems</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"8682a5ca-480a-4bd0-ad72-9c4fa2f186a4">
<li local-id=3D"96fe37f2-41c5-4a58-8fed-08910aa0d9d7">
<p local-id=3D"088a3e971de2">The current page does not meet WCAG 2.1 Level =
A and AA standards</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a96c5c32-1567-4d97-95cf-563774d6233a">
<p local-id=3D"0644a58a2e69">Accessibility issues likely affect keyboard na=
vigation, focus handling, labeling, contrast, state changes, and screen rea=
der usability across both filtering and report display workflows</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cb94761d-854c-400c-9b74-8b82c7f25636">
<p local-id=3D"f9798eea0013">These issues create both compliance risk and u=
sability barriers</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"a3117eadc42c" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-UserNeeds">U=
ser Needs</h2>
<p local-id=3D"dd50d13a4293">Users need a reports experience that helps the=
m confidently choose filters, run reports, and interpret results without co=
nfusion.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"ec5d36013fef" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Coreuserneed=
s">Core user needs</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"1ca31dbf-0547-40b4-a0b1-990ce26abfd4">
<li local-id=3D"f87baebe-80a4-4ab9-99bc-09c996a57cfd">
<p local-id=3D"5adcfd1d7d36">Users need filter controls that behave consist=
ently and predictably across reports</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"03284bbb-2ac9-4db9-9527-b0637d440001">
<p local-id=3D"abaeb4ab2beb">Users need to understand which filters are req=
uired, optional, dependent on other choices, or unavailable based on contex=
t</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bcc77d6b-55e0-48c5-8bc8-97c1937b9739">
<p local-id=3D"9e5e5c189804">Users need changes to filters to be transparen=
t and explainable, rather than silently resetting related selections</p></l=
i>
<li local-id=3D"9f01bfaa-c477-4b01-a746-5392d1059edc">
<p local-id=3D"024a56c2dcab">Users need faster and clearer feedback while r=
eports are generating</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"abcbc6fc-9a41-4537-9a12-9e778767db13">
<p local-id=3D"bc917cd1b9f4">Users need on-screen results that are easier t=
o scan, understand, and use before exporting</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"832ba22b-be18-4a49-a515-c15775a48ba6">
<p local-id=3D"d7a73aa870ce">Users need accessibility support built into ev=
ery part of the experience</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ae0f0491-e9e0-40b4-a28a-c96edb6c9f31">
<p local-id=3D"397ab640f462">Users need the experience to feel modern and c=
ohesive across EV+ and PD Tracking, while still respecting permissions and =
product-specific report availability</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"f8facca94499" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-FunctionalRe=
quirementsDraft">Functional Requirements Draft</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"c1523cb51d1d" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-A.Reportdisc=
overyandselection">A. Report discovery and selection</h3>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"98076749-26f8-4b3b-b1c8-e5ee59d1bd20">
<li local-id=3D"ab66cead-9575-467a-b78b-2e3baaa5829d">
<p local-id=3D"5d59421660e9">The system shall display only reports availabl=
e to the user based on product access and permissions.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f5e44117-61af-4517-9e7e-2991f1e8955c">
<p local-id=3D"665747dd8f67">The system shall present report groupings and =
report names in a consistent, easy-to-scan format.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bda86011-3c5d-4070-b80c-ad8377fbb211">
<p local-id=3D"ecb9c8286615">The system shall preserve a consistent interac=
tion pattern for selecting and launching reports across EV+ and PD Tracking=
.</p></li>
</ol>
<h3 local-id=3D"8390d659aff6" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-B.Filterandp=
arameterconfiguration">B. Filter and parameter configuration</h3>
<ol start=3D"4" local-id=3D"46322e61-3ce9-4b8a-b49b-36769278460f">
<li local-id=3D"ee76b7a4-6505-4e27-8d5a-34716f258758">
<p local-id=3D"1cea62ec3c83">The system shall provide a consistent framewor=
k for report filter and parameter configuration, even when specific filters=
 vary by report.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"725fddf7-c42b-49a9-b98d-d28a729b4350">
<p local-id=3D"4580452230cf">The system shall clearly distinguish required =
filters from optional filters.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3f6e4d01-7c78-4885-a814-19a06189019d">
<p local-id=3D"f7f17f26a83e">The system shall clearly indicate when a filte=
r is dependent on another filter selection.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e302e285-9a34-491d-ae81-7fae8ba00724">
<p local-id=3D"ecc1c6ebf38a">The system shall provide reusable filter compo=
nents for common patterns used across multiple reports.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bc3a1dcc-779e-4250-bdfc-61859a217e67">
<p local-id=3D"91431490cdb2">The system shall make filter behavior predicta=
ble and transparent when one selection affects another.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ea252815-eba8-4e6b-892a-d816d2c8daa4">
<p local-id=3D"bec4ea4a0946">The system shall notify users when changing on=
e filter will clear, update, or invalidate another filter selection.</p></l=
i>
<li local-id=3D"f03cd3f9-e9d9-4151-ab6d-a6fb466e251d">
<p local-id=3D"e622c958a43d">The system shall minimize unnecessary modal-dr=
iven interactions for filter selection where possible.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"105336ab-f317-4464-8423-d10dc820824b">
<p local-id=3D"b7bfeba357e4">The system shall support more intuitive multi-=
step narrowing of large datasets when advanced selection is required.</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"608b3177-e9d9-4153-a305-c3c7fc455da9">
<p local-id=3D"b0fb7c3ec5e8">The system shall provide clear empty, default,=
 and selected states for all filter controls.</p></li>
</ol>
<h3 local-id=3D"1fdbd7ca338b" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-C.Reportgene=
rationworkflow">C. Report generation workflow</h3>
<ol start=3D"13" local-id=3D"d4cc05f4-f8c2-4327-87d5-c2271bd285b5">
<li local-id=3D"3887ff24-4b98-4869-9ccb-a8021127971a">
<p local-id=3D"fefe29d18fe7">The system shall provide visible feedback when=
 a report is being generated.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fb6a8dca-de60-4337-98d6-2e310d36875b">
<p local-id=3D"952e7b0f6e7b">The system shall provide clearer loading/progr=
ess states than a generic spinner alone.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2826d6ad-7e55-4d0c-80a8-a87471f38d11">
<p local-id=3D"b22590e90fd6">The system shall prevent duplicate or accident=
al repeat submissions while a report is generating.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a19f63c7-7528-4fc7-bc8f-09f023652ea7">
<p local-id=3D"3ea63502e047">The system shall provide clear error messaging=
 when a report cannot be generated.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1966491f-e9cb-4203-b281-212dfaf50ecd">
<p local-id=3D"644f91ca3a11">The system shall support generation workflows =
that are performant and compatible with the microservices architecture.</p>=
</li>
</ol>
<h3 local-id=3D"1af47bc3c08b" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-D.Resultsdis=
play">D. Results display</h3>
<ol start=3D"18" local-id=3D"5dfd1848-8b0a-43bd-917e-8cf725b50d4b">
<li local-id=3D"f09c6a5b-fd82-4b65-8a06-9176146704fe">
<p local-id=3D"e0d55015ad9c">The system shall display generated report resu=
lts in a more readable and scannable on-screen format.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8e175ee4-29bb-4b8b-803a-31de3d25f275">
<p local-id=3D"b8a121d85dde">The system shall improve the usability of tabu=
lar report output through modern table presentation patterns.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6bb3c94b-9639-44e1-9eaf-7d3647c20184">
<p local-id=3D"9de0a2d22bcd">The system shall support lightweight summary v=
isualizations where they add value to interpretation.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1eec2550-e686-4c0c-b864-87d589ed27ed">
<p local-id=3D"1de1f6ae4503">The system shall not require charting or visua=
lization for every report.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"20bfe1c3-028d-40f2-b4dc-e46a96faae02">
<p local-id=3D"9065efd5e028">The system shall maintain spreadsheet export a=
vailability for reports that currently support export.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3379dc54-265a-4d42-b76a-b7f19a7fea47">
<p local-id=3D"8f5d5e680339">The system shall ensure that on-screen results=
 remain aligned with the underlying existing report data and logic.</p></li=
>
</ol>
<h3 local-id=3D"622c319a4d57" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-E.Accessibil=
ity">E. Accessibility</h3>
<ol start=3D"24" local-id=3D"b8712a13-d822-4346-b3de-207ed2de6250">
<li local-id=3D"55115278-3a1b-4a31-ab4f-93e6bb586531">
<p local-id=3D"82b68f02e3a8">The system shall meet WCAG 2.1 Level A and AA =
requirements for the reports page experience.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9946d34b-01fb-4722-a657-2bf4842584da">
<p local-id=3D"9706693d7c09">The system shall support full keyboard navigat=
ion for report selection, filtering, report generation, and results review.=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"05dfb9e6-f058-4b72-ba14-f9cc7416f354">
<p local-id=3D"b73b31c5dd82">The system shall provide accessible labels, in=
structions, and state announcements for interactive controls.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"92af364c-3213-405b-86ca-74fc547bee3e">
<p local-id=3D"571dc0663cfc">The system shall support screen reader usabili=
ty across filter setup, loading states, and report results.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7e60d9d8-2488-49d7-9cf7-431259cb84cc">
<p local-id=3D"8094394cad11">The system shall meet required standards for f=
ocus visibility, color contrast, error identification, and semantic structu=
re.</p></li>
</ol>
<h3 local-id=3D"0749c74242de" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-F.Cross-prod=
uctconsistency">F. Cross-product consistency</h3>
<ol start=3D"29" local-id=3D"7a7dc9cf-e2cb-4d59-907b-26da5d9f5d46">
<li local-id=3D"1964f957-de7a-494e-bc5d-6f69f8a47be4">
<p local-id=3D"4b4edbb42456">The system shall provide a shared reports page=
 experience across EV+ and PD Tracking.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8cfbc646-5a54-4a22-8619-c60fe5c132f8">
<p local-id=3D"0da3df4483f5">The system shall allow report-specific variati=
ons without breaking the consistency of the overall interaction model.</p><=
/li>
</ol>
<h2 local-id=3D"8e07938e487c" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Non-Function=
alRequirementsDraft">Non-Functional Requirements Draft</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"d1c258272e3d" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Accessibilit=
yandcompliance">Accessibility and compliance</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"68743116-5a35-4484-acc2-3dfa413e5d5a">
<li local-id=3D"4ac1b7d5-f6e9-4cf0-b8ae-ed4b585d5a09">
<p local-id=3D"fd7ea9c85e3c">Must meet WCAG 2.1 A and AA standards</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"0cf120e4049a" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Performance.=
1">Performance</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"de0ae147-4be0-4199-bf69-9be5a72023fd">
<li local-id=3D"34271455-9109-4551-8815-0f580c9558c5">
<p local-id=3D"930ced320c61">Must improve report generation performance whe=
re feasible</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9a25de0f-7d22-4364-b1f5-ab6664e5848f">
<p local-id=3D"406839d606f1">Must improve perceived responsiveness even whe=
n backend generation time cannot be materially reduced</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"25d8562e-f7fc-43f6-9790-4aacad85de8b">
<p local-id=3D"304b9dab5060">Must avoid introducing regressions in report g=
eneration reliability</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"35e2c348a422" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Architecture=
">Architecture</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"a3b6ebe2-4208-4871-a887-39efb6cdc3c3">
<li local-id=3D"38747938-a472-47ba-be35-bee9afe6a9e0">
<p local-id=3D"d708782e43d4">Must support migration of the reports page to =
microservices</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7a59c055-c72c-4232-b420-ffde2fa366ad">
<p local-id=3D"c7c4c47f8879">Must align with agreed microservices patterns =
and integration requirements</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"2a9ce86b2545" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Usabilityand=
consistency">Usability and consistency</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"63c34707-8833-4317-b5b6-561cf806696c">
<li local-id=3D"b8c4388b-74df-4e1c-a197-9eb9e15afa85">
<p local-id=3D"d28db065d369">Must support reusable UI patterns/components f=
or common filter types</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b3f07291-8bcd-4dfd-a783-e07ee9d7988d">
<p local-id=3D"0ac3fa224454">Must provide a consistent cross-report interac=
tion model where feasible</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"bbd3ab0c0d31" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Reliability"=
>Reliability</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"3b11cc0e-9e30-4ae0-be86-5ff55323b959">
<li local-id=3D"8fa23b1c-847e-4126-9013-15b02c2aec5d">
<p local-id=3D"3dfa023a5f19">Must preserve current report availability by p=
ermissions and product entitlements</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"109b657c-2bad-454b-9866-6a53bc344bb5">
<p local-id=3D"87a7f5ba2454">Must preserve existing report logic and data o=
utputs</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"458f0466465d" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Assumptionsa=
ndConstraints">Assumptions and Constraints</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"4af578422e46" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Assumptions"=
>Assumptions</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"cb6a256b-cdac-4406-b887-0c5c50d119fa">
<li local-id=3D"fa86d996-80bb-4e34-98ae-488041546801">
<p local-id=3D"2a72e723d86e">Report definitions, calculations, and datasets=
 will remain unchanged</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4d514110-d399-4295-81d1-eed3efc22964">
<p local-id=3D"4a588d1b4cff">Many reports share enough filter patterns to j=
ustify reusable components</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"af21be70-3e8e-4cd4-b022-240b719ef790">
<p local-id=3D"a94cab269116">Users will continue to rely on spreadsheet exp=
ort for deeper analysis</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8ad592ba-5a9c-4c82-9adc-97ffdd39b7d9">
<p local-id=3D"1b8e7208a49d">On-screen visualization should remain lightwei=
ght rather than evolve into full dashboarding</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"c5367bba493c" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Constraints"=
>Constraints</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"ae867e02-8f50-4ede-9aee-354bcda1b0c4">
<li local-id=3D"b00b15da-e5c9-4fc7-9d97-362401177e4a">
<p local-id=3D"7075014f3692">Project scope is limited to the reports page U=
I, including filter setup and on-screen results display</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bffda30f-182d-463c-967c-c361886dfa4f">
<p local-id=3D"53eb187f2b4c">No new reports will be created as part of this=
 effort</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"188746d3-9c40-4a86-bd4c-d73269183d71">
<p local-id=3D"f80ce8fb83fd">No existing report logic will be redesigned as=
 part of this effort</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"81a5db10-2b1f-456e-9e8b-10deadbae371">
<p local-id=3D"0d606cc826cd">The effort must accommodate both EV+ and PD Tr=
acking in a shared experience</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ea165518-662d-4494-94eb-f0ba2edd7351">
<p local-id=3D"6ef72f492df1">The effort must be implemented in the context =
of a microservices migration</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"29e9cd40da3d" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-OpenQuestion=
s/DecisionsNeeded">Open Questions / Decisions Needed</h2>
<p local-id=3D"98ff3115ddf8">This is where your sticky filter note belongs.=
</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"cf2dd8c51e14" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Openproduct/=
design/engineeringquestions">Open product/design/engineering questions</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"15169402-8d13-4d9f-bab8-9a13baf92d8e">
<li local-id=3D"6375153f-f871-4fdd-8b92-65344d246322">
<p local-id=3D"b5cdc8e2c912">Should the redesigned experience include <stro=
ng>sticky filters</strong> or saved filter state across sessions, reports, =
or navigation flows?</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6b3874df-4299-4bbb-8d38-3bd0cfdd178c">
<p local-id=3D"62dfb94f4618">If sticky filters are supported, should persis=
tence be per user, per report, per session, or per product context?</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"7a696103-c422-4993-a8c3-26d86d58b1ac">
<p local-id=3D"50c9e98322af">Which filter interactions should remain modal-=
based, if any?</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"977c78db-00c0-4357-9ac9-2f2010f44263">
<p local-id=3D"173b974c8185">What is the minimum viable set of lightweight =
visualizations that improves comprehension without expanding scope into das=
hboarding?</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f3fd08da-2b14-4a24-a5e6-381a69b61320">
<p local-id=3D"8ec5c609d2d4">Which table improvements are highest priority =
for phase 1: sorting, column resizing, density, freezing headers, summaries=
, better spacing, or row expansion?</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7498167c-621e-49be-aced-93b0314debfd">
<p local-id=3D"2cbabecfb3d3">What loading/progress feedback is technically =
feasible with the planned architecture?</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"067af510-ae85-44f9-b651-4fb02fb291d9">
<p local-id=3D"f18b19979fd7">Are there any reports with unique filter workf=
lows that should be handled as exceptions rather than forced into shared co=
mponents?</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"17012014a329">
<h1 local-id=3D"0a7cfb5e30f7" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-ExpandedScop=
e">Expanded Scope</h1>
<p local-id=3D"56a75554b2ce">While the approved scope is limited to accessi=
bility, microservices migration, filter workflow improvements, and on-scree=
n report display modernization, the redesign could provide a foundation for=
 future enhancements that further improve reporting usability and value.</p=
>
<p local-id=3D"e1592ecb1a90">Potential expansion opportunities include:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"cbe3845e-6a7c-4dad-a692-2ce6edc502aa">
<li local-id=3D"93f79e79-e75e-4d61-982b-6753fdcdda29">
<p local-id=3D"ecb4ada1055a">user favorites for frequently used reports</p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"69670230-32c1-44c0-ab42-413009f390f0">
<p local-id=3D"494f2e66121f">saved or sticky report filter configurations</=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"38001037-31da-44ec-bbcf-d5001543d810">
<p local-id=3D"4206973ded26">recent report history and rerun shortcuts</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"2a623939-ec6d-497c-b260-0676c8ac2f76">
<p local-id=3D"6aa0a5c190b8">richer lightweight data visualizations</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"e7a5c19e-8190-47b3-b1d0-190681416811">
<p local-id=3D"69d8db66f0a0">improved table interaction patterns such as so=
rting and sticky headers</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c42ef039-f6b4-438d-b16f-83f92e15025a">
<p local-id=3D"dc198c4cd6fa">PDF export for selected reports, including vis=
ual summaries where appropriate</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"340b1d4e-28c9-4283-a43a-ea815905dc5b">
<p local-id=3D"37554952737e">a more flexible report workspace experience th=
at helps users interpret and share results without always relying on spread=
sheet export</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"c58ea8cd7d65" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Expandedoppo=
rtunityareas">Expanded opportunity areas</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"7491fd9fa631" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-1)Favoritesa=
ndsavedconfigurations">1) Favorites and saved configurations</h3>
<p local-id=3D"09e2c4b46217">This feels like one of the strongest expansion=
 ideas because it directly addresses repeated usage.</p>
<p local-id=3D"d99e0a39d2b6">Possible additions:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"86b06a56-5904-4068-a8ad-3e9f3766b253">
<li local-id=3D"6a2c3664-003f-45c5-a6ea-354dc0814a4e">
<p local-id=3D"7af752d6384e">favorite reports</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3ff8582a-be44-4653-9424-7c21dd64e10b">
<p local-id=3D"e677390efe1f">favorite report + filter combination</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b457676b-25f0-4a3b-ab48-c522e68cbb33">
<p local-id=3D"aa47516e9162">recent reports</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d98352d9-bc48-476c-abfa-6d563fc000fb">
<p local-id=3D"6973850d0e28">saved report views/configurations</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d21e69b7-4d9e-4b01-92e4-109e773e0c4c">
<p local-id=3D"5eddca6d0377">=E2=80=9Crun again=E2=80=9D shortcuts</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2e458692-885e-4fbc-b3a8-e65847183c23">
<p local-id=3D"7e64a0d7553c">user-specific saved defaults</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"2302ad5fed41">Why it matters:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"5604a680-9fbd-4b0b-9f03-d052459fc952">
<li local-id=3D"b6edba90-3e17-4c80-8da8-23b0a63569d7">
<p local-id=3D"f81f7b7fbec1">reduces friction for repeat users like admins/=
evaluators</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a51b5e5f-2776-4897-bbf0-9ae8b36e758b">
<p local-id=3D"07c7abb1be56">makes the page feel more personalized and effi=
cient</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"02bc2c36-d04f-4528-8949-453013b5b85a">
<p local-id=3D"9ca5101b5a1f">helps users who regularly answer the same oper=
ational questions</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"b7d553d2ed3d">Important product decision:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"92ed187d-06ea-4594-8277-938641b2ffe1">
<li local-id=3D"feb68a65-83ec-470b-a0de-5b2be0a0004b">
<p local-id=3D"db81c6e8758e">should saved filters be tied to just the repor=
t, or the report + permission context + school/site/product context?</p></l=
i>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"7597d4914887" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Moremeaningf=
ulon-screendatavisualization">More meaningful on-screen data visualization<=
/h3>
<p local-id=3D"d83b4ddb20a6">This is the next strongest area.</p>
<p local-id=3D"dd8a79c7b72e">Today, users often need to run a report and th=
en export it just to interpret it better. Expanded scope could make the on-=
screen experience more useful before export.</p>
<p local-id=3D"b97185e2ef5e">Possible additions:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"673d2fd6-91d8-468e-b689-587f2ed613bf">
<li local-id=3D"c1a3b6df-e390-425b-b56d-ef3b00b36cb8">
<p local-id=3D"6c7111f0aeb9">lightweight summary cards above tables</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"07d6edaa-f82e-4c35-8315-d3d418c10a4a">
<p local-id=3D"66b86de7f21a">bar charts instead of mostly pie charts</p></l=
i>
<li local-id=3D"733dbcac-8887-455c-8366-35666c0305b4">
<p local-id=3D"c593f62d49de">trend lines for time-based reports</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cbb60039-d3aa-4340-91ef-475b96127a70">
<p local-id=3D"281d09097a81">grouped summaries by common dimensions</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"c56a0204-3934-43c8-ae1a-70114c38f0a7">
<p local-id=3D"b32f86412013">report-level =E2=80=9Ckey takeaways=E2=80=9D v=
isual blocks</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f3fefb03-0cd1-4333-a72d-1435ad7353a9">
<p local-id=3D"cf6300f006b5">expandable visual summary + detailed table bel=
ow</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"5603c4689a27">Why this matters:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"efd60b4f-5595-4634-8335-748d012069df">
<li local-id=3D"e970c7ae-0fe8-4e2c-92c2-549d6d80df65">
<p local-id=3D"e9008c1d9d72">helps users answer quick questions without imm=
ediate export</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a3f35af2-9ad4-46a5-b47b-5714cc47ecb9">
<p local-id=3D"fff4597d0a5b">moves the experience slightly closer to dashbo=
ard value without requiring a full dashboards product</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e9351008-2f55-45e9-aa74-1698724e8a3b">
<p local-id=3D"1b56e9d838a8">makes reports more presentation-friendly and m=
odern</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"f3e7f758a9fd">Good guardrail:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"e4d0acad-7d82-4edd-b2d0-70ad884c6dde">
<li local-id=3D"9efffdc5-8f14-4757-8f15-266d3ef64172">
<p local-id=3D"3abcf4656ffb">visualizations should <strong>augment</strong>=
, not replace, the table/report output</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2f063e3f-1995-4e7b-b4a0-f7d2fb8eb8bf">
<p local-id=3D"f9541e21c918">not every report needs a chart</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"86fbf263-d689-42e7-bc60-040dd63e53d6">
<p local-id=3D"8015e1dce69e">charts should be chosen based on the data type=
 and user task</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"f2b1d1006537" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-PDFoutputwit=
hvisualizationsupport">PDF output with visualization support</h3>
<p local-id=3D"4c705ddd5f99">This is a smart add because it bridges reporti=
ng and sharing.</p>
<p local-id=3D"a48cff9a0b5a">Possible additions:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"8ebfa81c-046c-4a43-9e9d-4248126d2454">
<li local-id=3D"4f68a419-626a-4973-91f9-7c60a4405125">
<p local-id=3D"96dd264b228b">export report to PDF</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f6ac9a57-2545-4cb2-a0aa-44a10859630b">
<p local-id=3D"63e24f88d6d8">PDF includes visual summaries/charts plus tabu=
lar output</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"db0544ff-5883-4ef1-9a28-c69a68523f4c">
<p local-id=3D"cd7db1639254">presentation-ready layout for leadership revie=
ws, compliance packets, or meetings</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c8e6fa37-ad75-4b92-a9f1-19ca84918dcb">
<p local-id=3D"f617c475e8e4">branded/clean export formatting</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"9b1ad024bdee">Why it matters:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"d1e23e7b-9d6d-42db-8ef0-79854b1eb8d6">
<li local-id=3D"aef82225-3c3f-42e2-ad7a-d5e146e5fa72">
<p local-id=3D"05ded975e09d">users often need something easier to share tha=
n a spreadsheet</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a3790bfe-a29f-4489-9ca5-24ca47509e71">
<p local-id=3D"f21b67a21ccb">useful for presentations, compliance review, a=
nd leadership communication</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"155850ec-f989-46bf-bf75-a16a3546b47b">
<p local-id=3D"d2d8e83f97ef">creates value from improved visualizations bey=
ond the in-app screen</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"ddf1d15c05cf">Important questions:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"706f7c85-a0f1-4cad-801a-e78792501640">
<li local-id=3D"b1e67133-b35d-4c57-ac33-7e7e98114ada">
<p local-id=3D"8beac621f736">should PDF mirror exactly what is on screen, o=
r provide a more polished summary format?</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b5abeb5e-d2b1-4862-a733-b165274df49c">
<p local-id=3D"84ddbd74b779">should all reports support PDF, or only report=
s with strong visual summary use cases?</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fe858fba-7248-4640-a2c5-dfbc84e0b1de">
<p local-id=3D"f56fa272f40f">do users need full-detail PDF, summary PDF, or=
 both?</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"bb84298f4a51" id=3D"EV+ReportsPageRedesignReq.-Moreflexible=
resultsinteraction">More flexible results interaction</h3>
<p local-id=3D"a04bbb6bb107">You called out sorting and sticky headers. Tho=
se are great =E2=80=9Cmiddle ground=E2=80=9D enhancements because they are =
practical and not too visionary.</p>
<p local-id=3D"048f5b64df2f">Possible additions:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"82d18dba-6ce2-4aa1-a037-3a49557fb9ba">
<li local-id=3D"e458c04e-fd09-485a-a03e-0c9b77c06373">
<p local-id=3D"89ef8ac8f428">sortable columns</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ae0b48df-362c-4b10-8843-a1a6c4cdb88a">
<p local-id=3D"fc2f42289e96">sticky headers</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bb46de91-b5b9-4e17-89b1-aa4a0efe857d">
<p local-id=3D"e8aed0cfe6b8">freeze first column on wide tables</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b8ca7377-f0fa-45ac-bb81-89cc8d1dfbaa">
<p local-id=3D"d9dbdde8a94c">row density options</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f8c34c27-41fe-4646-b666-fe2ad7e990ab">
<p local-id=3D"964f6649f986">better spacing and hierarchy</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5621446b-fc6c-444b-b2f2-94459a3d1ae7">
<p local-id=3D"2391fa1f2b0b">summary row / totals row</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7a6901b9-d58a-4014-8ecd-9b57736bb79d">
<p local-id=3D"1b1d29ab30c7">expand/collapse long text</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c9f8daa1-ac11-4ed6-9976-ced7ee365678">
<p local-id=3D"cecbfd2c86f6">column show/hide for wide reports</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"7b457dfdf1d4">Why it matters:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"da055686-57e6-4460-b69c-b546d7aaa84c">
<li local-id=3D"9de3af2f-b56a-47f9-ae92-1be1f90772ab">
<p local-id=3D"d848c04a4e98">improves usability immediately</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"864574ce-f3bf-4a3b-885e-697162e11127">
<p local-id=3D"ef80eecd98e2">reduces reliance on export for basic scanning<=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"34ab5443-469a-4ed2-a0cf-f7a68122f353">
<p local-id=3D"164b6e1b2c05">especially helpful for large reports</p></li>
</ul>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
